  vendorName: Magnate Thorne
  offerText: I have purchased the city's entire clean water supply. Pay my heavily
    inflated rate for this bulky water jug, or face the grim reality of severe dehydration.
  acceptResultText: You pay the outrageous price and drag the heavy jug inside. You
    drink deeply, grateful to survive another hour.
  rejectResultText: You refuse to pay his absurd prices. You spend the rest of the
    hour parched, weak, and dizzy from extreme dehydration.
